<div class="wp-block-group ifm-legal__body"><!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"who","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="who"><span>01</span> Who is responsible</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>This website is run by IamFamous ("we", "us"). Our postal address is 27 Old Gloucester Street, London, WC1N 3AX, United Kingdom and our email is <a href="mailto:support@iamfamous.uk">support@iamfamous.uk</a>. We are the controller of the personal information described here.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"what","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="what"><span>02</span> What we collect</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:list {"className":"ifm-ticks"} -->
<ul class="wp-block-list ifm-ticks"><!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><strong>Enquiries:</strong> your name, email address, website, the service you ask about and your message.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><strong>Orders:</strong> your name, email, billing details, what you bought and the order history.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><strong>Project details:</strong> the answers and files you give us so we can do the work, such as business details, logos and access invitations.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><strong>Your account:</strong> your login email and an encrypted password.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><strong>Technical data:</strong> a scrambled, shortened form of your IP address kept briefly to stop spam through our forms, and standard server logs kept by our hosting company.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We do not collect card numbers. We do not use advertising trackers or analytics cookies on this site.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"why","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="why"><span>03</span> Why we use it and our legal basis</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:list {"className":"ifm-ticks"} -->
<ul class="wp-block-list ifm-ticks"><!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><strong>To carry out your order</strong> and keep you informed about it (performance of a contract).</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><strong>To reply to your enquiry</strong> (steps taken at your request before a contract, and our legitimate interest in answering people who contact us).</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><strong>To keep accounting records</strong> (a legal obligation).</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><strong>To protect the site</strong> from spam and abuse (our legitimate interest in keeping it secure).</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We do not send marketing emails unless you have asked for them, and we do not make automated decisions about you.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"sharing","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="sharing"><span>04</span> Who we share it with</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We share personal information only with suppliers who help us run the business, and only as far as they need it: our website hosting company, the payment provider you pay through, our email provider, and the platforms your order involves when you have given us access to them. We may also share information when the law requires it.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Some of these suppliers may process information outside the United Kingdom. Where they do, we rely on the safeguards UK data protection law allows, such as adequacy decisions or standard contractual clauses.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"keeping","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="keeping"><span>05</span> How long we keep it</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:list {"className":"ifm-ticks"} -->
<ul class="wp-block-list ifm-ticks"><!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><strong>Orders and invoices:</strong> 6 years, because tax law requires it.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><strong>Project details and files:</strong> for the life of the order and up to 12 months after, so we can help with follow-up questions. Ask and we will delete them sooner.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><strong>Enquiries that did not become orders:</strong> up to 12 months.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item -->

<!-- wp:list-item -->
<li><strong>Spam-protection data:</strong> a matter of minutes.</li>
<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"rights","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="rights"><span>06</span> Your rights</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>You can ask us for a copy of your information, ask us to correct or delete it, ask us to limit how we use it, object to our using it, and ask for it in a portable form. To use any of these rights, email us. We reply within one month and there is no charge.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>If you are unhappy with how we have handled your information, please tell us first. You also have the right to complain to the Information Commissioner's Office at ico.org.uk.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"security","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="security"><span>07</span> How we protect it</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The site uses an encrypted connection. Access to orders and files is limited to the people who need it, and uploaded files are stored outside the public part of the website. No system is perfectly secure, so please do not send us passwords or sensitive personal information that the order does not need.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"cookies","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="cookies"><span>08</span> Cookies</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>This site uses only the cookies needed for the basket, checkout and login to work. Details are in our <a href="/cookie-policy/">cookie policy</a>.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"anchor":"changes","className":"ifm-legal__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading ifm-legal__h" id="changes"><span>09</span> Changes to this policy</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>If we change how we use personal information, we will update this page and change the date at the top.</p>
